<title>AUSTRIA: MOTORCYCLING-DOOHAN WINS AUSTRIAN 500CC GRAND PRIX.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLING-DOOHAN WINS AUSTRIAN 500CC GRAND PRIX.</headline>
<dateline>ZELTWEG, Austria 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Michael Doohan won the Austrian 500cc Grand Prix on Sunday.  </p>
<p>Doohan's Japanese Honda team mate Tadayuki Okada was second and Italian Luca Cadalora, riding a Yamaha, was third.</p>
